%% name: module-descriptor-lifecycle
%% PROUVE : rien encore — machine a etats PROPOSEE (enum ModuleState, crate this-descriptor, RFC §3.2 et §3.7).
%% Le test lifecycle_transitions_are_legal_only du flux modules-runtime doit refuser toute transition absente ici.
%% NON ETABLI : la duree maximale de Draining (delai de grace) reste a fixer par le flux modules-runtime.
    [*] --> Discovered : catalogue ou ModuleStore
    Discovered --> Resolving : load()
    Resolving --> Resolved : dependances ok
    Resolving --> Failed : manquante, version, cycle, doublon
    Resolved --> Loading
    Loading --> Loaded : ModuleInterface construite
    Loading --> Failed : descripteur invalide
    Loaded --> Activating
    Activating --> Active : DescriptorSet et routes publies
    Activating --> Failed : conflit de route
    Active --> Active : unload refuse, dependants actifs
    Active --> Draining : unload()
    Draining --> Unloaded : requetes en vol terminees
    Unloaded --> Discovered : rechargement
    Failed --> Discovered : correction puis load()
    Unloaded --> [*]

    classDef refusedS fill:#e5484d33,stroke:#e5484d,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:6 3
    classDef okS fill:#2ea04333,stroke:#2ea043,stroke-width:2px
    classDef todoS fill:#f0a02033,stroke:#d98a00,stroke-width:2px
    class Failed refusedS
    class Active okS
    class Draining todoS
